sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client script
    participant S as Server
    Note over C,S: Synchronous: one request, client blocked until the full answer
    C->>S: GET /api/v1/devices/1/config (timeout=5)
    activate C
    Note left of C: blocked, can do nothing else
    Note right of S: works for 1.5 s
    S-->>C: 200 OK  "hostname csr1"
    deactivate C
    Note over C,S: Same call with timeout=0.5
    C->>S: GET /api/v1/devices/1/config (timeout=0.5)
    activate C
    Note left of C: gives up at 0.5 s → TimeoutError
    deactivate C
    S--xC: answer at 1.5 s, nobody is listening
